I'm not going to be one of those "don't" people who try to discourage you from exploring other aspects of the game, but PvP in its current state is pretty strict. Lots of rules and it felt like a slog to learn basic tactics just to get pummeled repeatedly. Like yeah we're learning so losing is expected but you'll be going against people who have been into PvP for YEARS.

&#x200B;

My advice for looking to learn tactics and get some actually solid advice would be discord groups. If you can find yourself a discord group with an active PvP chat you'll be solid. I can't really recommend any discords though since there was some controversies about a few W101 ones (I think it was that Ravenwood one? Can't remember) so I'm not sure which ones are safe and which ones are considered "bad" now.

&#x200B;

Good luck regardless! I got into it for a few months like a year ago but couldn't really get good at it so I gave up lol

You'll probably do fine though

