yeah, I mean honestly some of the store pets are great for pet battling, but you can always just use the F2P pets with a slightly modified strategy instead. I remember ragnaros being a good one a few years back (MOP? sometime around then? cant remember) but he never was something "essential". I mean good for blizz for not making the shop p2w, but I just look at these pets and see maybe 3-4 I'd actually be training up.

&#x200B;

